@{
    Layout = "/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

@section HeaderImage
{
    <div class="headerImage2">
        <img src="~/images/talenmt-scouting.png" />
    </div>
}
<div class="hometext">
    <p class="paraCommon" style="text-align:center">
        <img src="/images/talentscoutig1.png" width="50%" />
    </p>
    <div class="">
        <p class="paraCommon paraHeader">
            <b>Screening & Testing; Good hiring isn’t an exam - it’s a match</b>
            <span style="font:20px">Stop testing memory - Start testing mindset.</span>
        </p>

        <p class="paraCommon">Present day processes including aptitude tests don’t reveal curiosity, adaptability, or sincerity but conversations do. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Today’s green workforce evaluates you as much as you evaluate them. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>When screening becomes collaborative instead of judgmental, the right talent feels safe to show their real strengths.</b></p>
        <p class="paraCommon">You’re not filtering people out, you’re filtering possibilities in.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Old hiring = “Tell me why I should pick you.” Green hiring = “Let’s see if we match each other’s future.”</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Instead of aptitude traps and sterile interviews, companies win when they test curiosity, creativity, adaptability, and authenticity. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><i>Gen Z hates being interrogated. </i></p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><i>Millennials hate irrelevant tasks.</i></p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><i>Mid-career pros hate disrespect. </i></p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><i>Silver talent hates condescension.</i></p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>So, the test becomes simple: Let us find if We can think together?</b></p>
        <p class="paraCommon">
            Click Here to Participate in Talent Screening & Testing Poll
            <a href="/visitor/poll/51" class="homeImage"><img src="~/images/audience-poll.png" width="70px" /></a>
        </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"> </p>
    </div>
</div>
